---
// One HTTP request, left to right, and the limit that covers each wait.
// Values (1 s, 1 s, 2 s, 5 s) are the ones in the post's http.Client code.
const phases = [
  { x: 20, en: 'Connect', vi: 'Kết nối', limit: 'DialContext', val: '1 s', note: true },
  { x: 240, en: 'TLS handshake', vi: 'Bắt tay TLS', limit: 'TLSHandshakeTimeout', val: '1 s', note: true },
  { x: 460, en: 'Wait for headers', vi: 'Chờ header phản hồi', limit: 'ResponseHeaderTimeout', val: '2 s', note: true },
  { x: 680, en: 'Read the body', vi: 'Đọc body', limit: '', val: '', note: false },
];
---
<figure class="gp14a">
  <div class="gp14a-scroll">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 900 270" role="img" aria-label="One HTTP request in four waits: connect, TLS handshake, wait for response headers and read the body. Three Transport limits cover the first three waits, and Client.Timeout of 5 seconds covers all four.">
    <text x="20" y="24" class="h">
      <tspan data-lang-en>One request, four places to wait</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Một request, bốn chỗ để chờ</tspan>
    </text>
    {phases.map((p) => (
      <g>
        <rect x={p.x} y="40" width="200" height="52" rx="6" class="box" />
        <text x={p.x + 100} y="72" text-anchor="middle" class="b">
          <tspan data-lang-en>{p.en}</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>{p.vi}</tspan>
        </text>
        {p.note ? (
          <g>
            <line x1={p.x} x2={p.x + 200} y1="108" y2="108" class="ln" />
            <text x={p.x} y="132" class="b">{p.limit}</text>
            <text x={p.x} y="152" class="m num">{p.val}</text>
          </g>
        ) : (
          <g>
            <line x1={p.x} x2={p.x + 200} y1="108" y2="108" class="ln" style="stroke: var(--red); stroke-dasharray: 4 3" />
            <text x={p.x} y="132" class="r"><tspan data-lang-en>No Transport limit</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Transport không có giới hạn</tspan></text>
          </g>
        )}
      </g>
    ))}
    <rect x="20" y="176" width="860" height="36" rx="6" class="bad" style="fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text)" />
    <text x="36" y="200" class="b">Client.Timeout <tspan class="num">5 s</tspan></text>
    <text x="250" y="200" class="m">
      <tspan data-lang-en>one deadline for all four waits, body included</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>một hạn chót chung cho cả bốn chỗ chờ, kể cả body</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="20" y="246" class="m">
      <tspan data-lang-en>The default client has none of these limits: every value is 0, which means wait for ever.</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Client mặc định không có giới hạn nào ở trên: mọi giá trị đều là 0, nghĩa là chờ mãi.</tspan>
    </text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>The limits are the ones set in the <code>http.Client</code> code above. A stalled server usually stops at the third wait, which is why <code>ResponseHeaderTimeout</code> and <code>Client.Timeout</code> matter most.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Các giới hạn là những giá trị đặt trong đoạn code <code>http.Client</code> ở trên. Server bị treo thường dừng ở chỗ chờ thứ ba, nên <code>ResponseHeaderTimeout</code> và <code>Client.Timeout</code> quan trọng nhất.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .gp14a { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .gp14a-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .gp14a svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .gp14a text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .gp14a .h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gp14a .b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gp14a .m { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .gp14a .r { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
  .gp14a .num { font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .gp14a .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .gp14a .own { fill: none; stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; stroke-dasharray: 4 3; }
  .gp14a .bad { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .gp14a .ln { fill: none; stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .gp14a .ah { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .gp14a .grid { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; }
  .gp14a figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
